# Identity of the app being shipped.
#
# Both values come from GitHub Actions *variables* (not secrets — a team id and
# a bundle id are not confidential), so nothing App-Store-specific is hardcoded
# in the repo. The fallbacks match the placeholders in ios/project.yml and are
# rejected by the workflow preflight, so a misconfigured run fails instead of
# uploading to the wrong app record.
app_identifier(ENV.fetch('CRIBWIRE_APP_IDENTIFIER', 'example.cribwire.CribWire'))
team_id(ENV.fetch('CRIBWIRE_APPLE_TEAM_ID', ''))

# Authentication is via the App Store Connect API key (see Fastfile), so no
# `apple_id` / Apple ID password is needed or wanted here.
